{"t":"ACN","n":"Accenture plc","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":222.29,"chg":1.12,"chgPct":0.00506,"prev":221.17,"dayH":224.23,"dayL":220.09,"w52H":291.09,"w52L":118.15,"vol":3843581,"avgVol":4375090,"mcap":131315032064,"pe":16.39,"fpe":13.97,"eps":13.56,"feps":15.91,"pb":4.19,"div":6.84,"divY":0.0308,"beta":1.0,"short":21090193,"shortPct":0.04,"shortRatio":2.6,"prof":{"c":"Ireland","cKo":"아일랜드","s":"Technology","sKo":"기술","i":"Information Technology Services","iKo":"정보 기술 서비스","city":"Dublin","emp":814000,"web":"https://www.accenture.com","sum":"Accenture plc provides consulting and managed services in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It offers artificial intelligence and data; cloud consulting; cybersecurity consulting; digital engineering and manufacturing; ecosystem partners; emerging technology; finance and risk management consulting; infrastructure and capital projects; digital learning; supply chain consulting; technology consulting; sustainability consulting; and metaverse solutions, as well as customer services. The company also provides proprietary assets and platforms, such as GenWizard, SynOps and reinvention.AI to clients. It serves aerospace and defense, automotive, banking, capital markets, chemicals, communications and media, consumer goods and services, energy, health, high tech,","sumKo":"Accenture plc는 미주, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카 및 아시아 태평양 지역에서 컨설팅 및 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 인공 지능과 데이터를 제공합니다. 클라우드 컨설팅; 사이버보안 컨설팅; 디지털 엔지니어링 및 제조; 생태계 파트너; 신흥 기술; 재무 및 위험 관리 컨설팅; 인프라 및 자본 프로젝트; 디지털 학습; 공급망 컨설팅; 기술 컨설팅; 지속가능성 컨설팅; 메타버스 솔루션은 물론 고객 서비스까지. 또한 이 회사는 GenWizard, SynOps 및 reinvention.AI와 같은 독점 자산과 플랫폼을 고객에게 제공합니다. 항공우주 및 방위, 자동차, 은행, 자본 시장, 화학, 통신 및 미디어, 소비재 및 서비스, 에너지, 건강, 첨단 기술,"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2023,"rev":64111745000,"ni":6878761000},{"y":2024,"rev":64896464000,"ni":7271985000},{"y":2025,"rev":69672977000,"ni":7685673000},{"y":2026,"rev":74183445000,"ni":8367056000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":18742125000,"ni":2211561000},{"q":"1Q